le/git/trees/900b1ff6981c32dafd0a5899747dc52cf1dbb14f"},"message":".github/scripts: add commit-lint rule with tests\n\nPure nushell rule modelled after tailscale/issuebot. Verbs (case-\ninsensitive, line start): close, closes, closed, fix, fixes, fixed,\nresolve, resolves, resolved, updates, for. Same line must contain\n'#' or 'github.com', so cross-repo refs (org/repo#N) and full GitHub\nURLs are accepted.\n\nSkip tokens: '[bot]' authors, Revert subjects, '#cleanup' lines,\n'skip-issuebot' anywhere in the body.\n\nThe rule is a pure function over (author, subject, body) so the\n25-case fixture suite drives it directly without spawning git.\nThe lint-range driver walks `git rev-list base..head` and emits\nGitHub workflow annotations on failure.\nskip-issuebot","parents":[{"sha":"3d5c0af4e703482aff8f979ff5bde330a7bf97f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3d5c0af4e703482aff8f979ff5bde330a7bf97f5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3d5c0af4e703482aff8f979ff5bde330a7bf97f5"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":25000959439,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz888AAAABA1f_qM8AAAAF0ixdzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25000959439","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"